    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/0e1ac0c72f8635e0e116c7d630955151.poster.avif?t=1676719505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/0e1ac0c72f8635e0e116c7d630955151.webm?t=1676719505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/0e1ac0c72f8635e0e116c7d630955151.mp4?t=1676719505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/4016a7f2504a9b90d26524cce3dbed8b.webp?t=1676719505\" /></div><br><strong>Invasion: Neo Earth is a retro sci-fi turn-based strategy game all about battling alien invaders to a soundtrack of Synthwave and Metal. </strong><br>Simple to pick up but challenging to master, it's all about action - you won't find base building, management sims or xp points here. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/02c4e01c30ca41c2144dbe7cb95aa41b.webp?t=1676719505\" /></div><br><strong>Great for fans of heavy riffs and desolate retrograde electronics!</strong> The soundtrack is an amalgam of Metal and Synthwave created by Three Rooks Music to bring to life the darkly retro science fiction setting of the game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/1c43c3821ab9728281e50ad48a9e6c44.poster.avif?t=1676719505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/1c43c3821ab9728281e50ad48a9e6c44.webm?t=1676719505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/1c43c3821ab9728281e50ad48a9e6c44.mp4?t=1676719505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/72a8d9d82a228d4b79f25630e796340f.webp?t=1676719505\" /></div><br>Swarms of UFO's. Insidious parasites that turn your troops into zombies. Hybrid mutant horrors toting heavy weaponry. Giant wasps! <strong>Three massive bosses that dominate the battlefield.</strong> Fight a vast menagerie of alien species controlled by their Sectyd masters. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/8f6bdb085b2cf7fad705fcf2f1a15784.webp?t=1676719505\" /></div><br>A freak meteorite shower brings alien invaders to the human colony planet NG-246. Command the planetary defense forces to deploy grunts, grav tanks, war robots and jets in battles across a retro sci-fi world. <strong>Choose which missions to fight to plot your path through the extensive campaign.</strong> Do you have what it takes to repel the monstrous hordes of the Sectyd?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/1bea5d9fd5df540eab765d3b5b228935.webp?t=1676719505\" /></div><br>Choose the loadout of every unit in your army, from a vast array of futuristic guns, launchers, lasers and cannons. Each unit has up to four weapons to choose from with different damage types that are more effective against certain enemies. <strong>Remember; if it's shiny it probably deflects lasers but hates bullets.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/34c02346a8db76162904c6492fb9e921.poster.avif?t=1676719505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/34c02346a8db76162904c6492fb9e921.webm?t=1676719505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/34c02346a8db76162904c6492fb9e921.mp4?t=1676719505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the Developer</h2>This game is the first release of IAO Games, a one-man development team from the UK focused on turn-based and action games with retro aesthetics and distinctive soundtracks.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/0e1ac0c72f8635e0e116c7d630955151.poster.avif?t=1676719505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/0e1ac0c72f8635e0e116c7d630955151.webm?t=1676719505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/0e1ac0c72f8635e0e116c7d630955151.mp4?t=1676719505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/4016a7f2504a9b90d26524cce3dbed8b.webp?t=1676719505\" /></div><br><strong>Invasion: Neo Earth is a retro sci-fi turn-based strategy game all about battling alien invaders to a soundtrack of Synthwave and Metal. </strong><br>Simple to pick up but challenging to master, it's all about action - you won't find base building, management sims or xp points here. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/02c4e01c30ca41c2144dbe7cb95aa41b.webp?t=1676719505\" /></div><br><strong>Great for fans of heavy riffs and desolate retrograde electronics!</strong> The soundtrack is an amalgam of Metal and Synthwave created by Three Rooks Music to bring to life the darkly retro science fiction setting of the game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/1c43c3821ab9728281e50ad48a9e6c44.poster.avif?t=1676719505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/1c43c3821ab9728281e50ad48a9e6c44.webm?t=1676719505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/1c43c3821ab9728281e50ad48a9e6c44.mp4?t=1676719505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/72a8d9d82a228d4b79f25630e796340f.webp?t=1676719505\" /></div><br>Swarms of UFO's. Insidious parasites that turn your troops into zombies. Hybrid mutant horrors toting heavy weaponry. Giant wasps! <strong>Three massive bosses that dominate the battlefield.</strong> Fight a vast menagerie of alien species controlled by their Sectyd masters. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/8f6bdb085b2cf7fad705fcf2f1a15784.webp?t=1676719505\" /></div><br>A freak meteorite shower brings alien invaders to the human colony planet NG-246. Command the planetary defense forces to deploy grunts, grav tanks, war robots and jets in battles across a retro sci-fi world. <strong>Choose which missions to fight to plot your path through the extensive campaign.</strong> Do you have what it takes to repel the monstrous hordes of the Sectyd?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/1bea5d9fd5df540eab765d3b5b228935.webp?t=1676719505\" /></div><br>Choose the loadout of every unit in your army, from a vast array of futuristic guns, launchers, lasers and cannons. Each unit has up to four weapons to choose from with different damage types that are more effective against certain enemies. <strong>Remember; if it's shiny it probably deflects lasers but hates bullets.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/34c02346a8db76162904c6492fb9e921.poster.avif?t=1676719505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/34c02346a8db76162904c6492fb9e921.webm?t=1676719505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660580/extras/34c02346a8db76162904c6492fb9e921.mp4?t=1676719505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the Developer</h2>This game is the first release of IAO Games, a one-man development team from the UK focused on turn-based and action games with retro aesthetics and distinctive soundtracks.",
